metadata/note = "Compact three-door hatchback, 1.62 m wide without the wing mirrors, its nose facing +z (the piece front), length along z. Door_L (the -x side) and Door_R hinge at their front edge about y and swing out; Boot (the tailgate with its glass) hinges at the roof's back edge about x and lifts. Hollow cabin: floor top 0.32 m, 0.14 m under the front seats, 0.12 m under the rear bench, a boot well about 1.0 x 0.6 m behind it. Window glass is the material 'glass' (alpha 0.3). crawl_gap is the ground clearance between the wheels; crawl_box (Godot, local [x, z]) the clear rect under the car, inside the wheels (house/11). Containers: Cabin (both doors) and Boot; colliders: the floor pan, bonnet, sides, roof, wheel tubs and wheels (the seats have none: Socks lie under them)."

